      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-obsidian-workbench bundle layer.\n# Host 半端：tools + settings + webServer + agents + approval 插件；Client 半端：shell.overlay 抽屉等 slot 注册。\n# name 必须用 npm 包名 '@dsh-external/dsh-obsidian-workbench'（与 dsh-noema 一致）：\n# dsh plugin add 安装的就是该 scoped 名，loader import(name) 才能解析；\n# 裸名 'dsh-obsidian-workbench' 只靠 link 环境存在，干净安装必挂（Gate 6 实测修复）。\n- insert:\n    - id: obsidian-workbench\n      name: '@dsh-external/dsh-obsidian-workbench'\n"
    }
